END DO
COMMENT ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ 1 ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^  END COMMENT

COMMENT VVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVV 1 VVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVV  END COMMENT
CREATE FANCTION
TAKE NAME no30fanc END TAKE
WITH
  CREATE NUMBER TAKE NAME RR END TAKE
END WITH
DO
  READ TAKE NAME no40fanc END TAKE WITH RR VALUE END WITH
END DO
COMMENT ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ 1 ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ END COMMENT

